","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123388.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nStatic lightmaps used to ignore the state of non visible lights, shadows on or off always render them, ignore also the marked shadows for double or single face cast.\r\n\r\nThere was a missing option to have static meshes getting only lightmaps but not affecting others, this solve the issue.\r\nAnother limitation was to allow or disallow the emissive light effect or not in the baker.\r\nAnother limitation solved it can contribute to the lightmap itself or not, so maybe don't want the light to bounce from given wall to the floor or given barrel lets say.\r\n\r\nThis solves and gives artistic control as COD2 like engine used to have to limit casting and shadows lightmaps from world structure to objects but not allow objects to have lightmaps, saving general performance and space.\r\n\r\nAbout the AI disclosure the common VS and VS Code assistants for autocomplete and fix lines, spot and cleanup structures and definitions and compare against the changes.\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/56870 \r\n- closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116775 \r\n- closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98684 \r\n- many others really\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1408\" height=\"993\" alt=\"godot windows editor x86_64_4gteutuBxJ\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f12f59ec-3d75-4da2-b8fe-3d3e1b1dc00a\" />\r\n\r\nThe shader ins't perfect sure have issues, and ported it from my 4.7 so may have some issues, it worked on my initial test at the demo scene from the closed issue reported at the top. Also noticed given scene have issues with normals and the sphere share curvature from the pointlights looks wrong.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123388/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123388/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}